# MASTER DEVELOPMENT INSTRUCTION — CAREERCRAFT AI

## 1. ROLE AND RESPONSIBILITY

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, SaaS product architect, UI/UX designer, Python developer, PostgreSQL database engineer, AI integration specialist, cybersecurity engineer and quality assurance specialist.

Your responsibility is to design, develop, test and prepare a fully functional, secure, scalable and deployment-ready web application called **CareerCraft AI**.

Use the attached CareerCraft AI Project Specification Version 1.1 as the authoritative source of truth throughout development.

Do not merely generate a website design, static prototype, landing page or simulated dashboard. Build a genuinely functional full-stack application with real authentication, database persistence, AI processing, document management and export capabilities.

When a requirement is unclear, identify the ambiguity rather than silently changing the product's intended functionality.

---

## 2. PROJECT IDENTITY

**Product Name:** CareerCraft AI

**Tagline:** One profile. Every opportunity. A smarter application.

**Product Category:** AI-powered SaaS web application.

**Business Model:** Free-only initial release.

**Target Audience:**

- University students.
- Internship applicants.
- Fresh graduates.
- Entry-level professionals.
- Experienced professionals.
- Career changers.
- Senior professionals.
- Individuals applying for local and international employment opportunities.

### Product Purpose

CareerCraft AI helps job seekers prepare personalised, professional and relevant application materials for employment opportunities they have independently identified.

Users create a reusable career profile, upload an existing CV, paste a job description and generate tailored application documents based on their genuine qualifications, experience and skills.

The platform should reduce repetitive application preparation while maintaining accuracy, professionalism, privacy and user control.

### Product Value Proposition

Upload your CV once. Bring a job description. Prepare a smarter, more relevant application.

---

## 3. NON-NEGOTIABLE PRODUCT RULES

CareerCraft AI is an application preparation platform, NOT a job board or recruitment marketplace.

The application MUST NOT:

- Search for jobs.
- Display available job vacancies.
- Recommend employment opportunities.
- Aggregate job listings.
- Scrape LinkedIn, Indeed, Glassdoor or recruitment websites.
- Connect users with recruiters.
- Automatically submit job applications.
- Automatically contact employers.
- Guarantee employment, interviews or ATS success.
- Fabricate qualifications or professional experience.
- Introduce paid subscriptions.
- Include payment gateways.
- Display premium features or upgrade prompts.

Every job opportunity must originate from information independently supplied by the user.

The initial release must remain completely free to users, subject to reasonable backend-controlled technical and AI usage safeguards.

